  m_Text: "Embark on an interstellar journey! In the game, explore vibrant <color=#F87>Descriptions</color>
    that breathe life into the lore of each celestial body. Command effortlessly
    with intuitive <color=#4AF>Controls</color>, easily tailored via the <color=#7FD>Settings</color>
    menu. Delve into interstellar wisdom with invaluable <color=#1FA>Tips</color>
    for mastering space survival\u2014conquer resource management, build strategic
    shelters, and unlock the secrets of thriving in diverse alien ecosystems."
